    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>The new Power BI usage metrics&nbsp;report allows you to monitor the views of your report and to see consumption percentages by platform. To see the different scenarios for embedded reports, simply hover over the data.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/UpdatesV2/blog/22a5dc28-4926-4982-a15f-fa271fb494c0.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"usageMetrics\" src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/UpdatesV2/blog/e6f19dc6-e41f-4b01-8f39-0c2bc39d89b7.gif\" title=\"usageMetrics\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://powerbi.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/announcing-improved-report-usage-metrics-in-modern-workspaces/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more about the new and improved Power BI usage metrics report</a>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "The new Power BI usage metrics report allows you to monitor the views of your report and to see consumption percentages by platform. To see the different scenarios for embedded reports, simply hover over the data.\n\nLearn more about the new and improved Power BI usage metrics report ."
  },
